• Device identifiers, such as Android ID\n
• App version and running status\n
• Device model and operating system version\n
• LSPosed version\n
• Magisk or KernelSU version, where applicable\n
• Network type and mobile carrier\n\n
We encrypt the data and do not associate it with your identity. We use it only to improve product features and do not share it with third parties.
</string>
